    },
    {
      "text": "$\\Delta \\mathrm{S}$ is positive",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\Delta S$ is negative",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A",
    "B",
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$\\Delta \\mathrm{G}$ is negative as process is spontaneous.\r\n$\\Delta \\mathrm{S}$ is negative due to association.\r\nTherefore to make $\\Delta$ G negative, $\\Delta H$ must be negative."
